# Port Configuration for AI App
# This file documents the port configuration for all services

## Port Assignments
WEB_PORT=40000          # Frontend web application
SERVER_PORT=40001       # Backend server API
WHISPER_PORT=40002      # Python whisper transcription service

## Environment Files Setup
# Each app has example and local environment files:
# - apps/web/env.example     → Copy to apps/web/.env
# - apps/server/env.example  → Copy to apps/server/.env  
# - apps/whisper/env.example → Copy to apps/whisper/.env

## Quick Setup Commands
# Copy environment files to .env (run from project root):
# cp apps/web/env.local apps/web/.env
# cp apps/server/env.local apps/server/.env
# cp apps/whisper/env.local apps/whisper/.env

## Running Whisper Service
# The whisper service now properly reads WHISPER_PORT environment variable
# Use these commands to start the service:
# bun dev:whisper          # Uses package.json scripts with port config
# cd apps/whisper && bun dev:env  # Explicitly sets environment variable

## Service URLs
# Web App: http://localhost:40000
# Server API: http://localhost:40001
# Whisper Service: http://localhost:40002
# Whisper API Docs: http://localhost:40002/docs
